    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n87260" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προεμ-πίπτω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>fall on</i> or <i>into before,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ βολὴ π. τῷ ὕδατι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hld.
					9.5
				</span></i>
			; <i>attack first,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ael.
				<u>Tact.</u>
				37.6
			</span></i>; <i>take the first step,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰς γνῶσιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.L.
					4.39
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>protrude into,</i> c. dat., <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				<u>UP</u>
				7.7
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προεμπίπτει τὰ χείλη,</span> of
			a bear trying to bite a net, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.918f
			</span></i>.</div>
